WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:52.992
Isn't it frustrating
when you're watching TV series or movie

00:04:53.226 --> 00:04:56.963
or you're listening to a song
and you can't understand what was said?

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.732
Usually this is not
because the person is speaking too fast.

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:03.002
Rather, it is
because you are not used to how natives

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:06.205
reduce, cut
and connect our words together.

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:08.207
However, you can learn it

00:05:08.207 --> 00:05:11.144
so that you can understand natives
no matter how fast we speak.

00:05:11.277 --> 00:05:14.914
And the most fun way to do this
is with our Fluent With Friends course.

00:05:15.014 --> 00:05:15.915
In this course,

00:05:15.915 --> 00:05:19.652
you will learn all of the most common
aspects of connected speech so that

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:23.723
you can confidently understand natives
and even improve your pronunciation.

00:05:23.823 --> 00:05:28.261
So you can give it a try now for free
with our 3-part master class.

00:05:28.294 --> 00:05:29.462
What are you waiting for?

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:32.632
Just click up here
or down in the description below to sign up now.

